  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xe4;rldsbanken, 2018, Social Accountability ESAP II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank, 2018, Social Accountability ESAP II - WB, 2018, ESAP II Social accountablity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened citizen demand for more equitable, effective, efficient, responsive and accountable basic service delivery, using social accountability interventions towards local government (woreda and regional) and its basic service providers are the basic objectives of ESAP in general and for the bridging phase in particular:
- Continuity of SA development on the ground and promotion of innovation. - Fostering and enhancing the social accountability dialogue at federal, regional and woreda levels.- Building a credible evidence base on results and impacts and elaboration of the next phase of ESAP.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats genomf&#xf6;rs inom ramen f&#xf6;r ett stort social service projekt som etiopiska regeringen och V&#xe4;rldsbanken genomf&#xf6;r. ESAP programmet bidrar till att fr&#xe4;mja dialog och samarbete mellan de som ska erh&#xe5;lla service och de som levererar social service i syfte att g&#xf6;ra &#xf6;ka kvalitet och kvantitet p&#xe5; servicen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to improved service delivery at local level through strengthened dialogue and interaction between service providers and those receiving the services.</narrative>
  </description>
